  "description": "Reads a DeepSharp pipeline's rows out of an Excel workbook, .xlsx, .xls or .xlsb: .ReadExcel(path) in the chain, read.excel in a pipeline file, replayed like any other file the pipeline reads. The first sheet unless one is named, its first row naming the columns; every cell as the sheet types it — a number, true or false, a date as a moment, never the text a culture happens to show — an empty cell empty, as the same sheet saved as comma-separated text would be, and an error as Excel spells it.",
